# Only sources, build props and the embedded report SQL go into the build context.
**/bin/
**/obj/
.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
tests/
deploy/
!deploy/docker/migrate/
docs/*
!docs/sql/
*.md
.env
.env.*
docker-compose*.yml
TestResults/
# The web client (Web.Dockerfile) installs its own dependencies and builds inside the image; local builds,
# dependencies and environment files never enter the context.
web/node_modules/
web/.next/
web/.env*
web/next-env.d.ts
